<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id">Haggai</book>
  <para style="h">Haggai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Haggai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Haggai</para>
  <para style="mt">Haggai</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darius ii Persia kumpilian a sep zawk a kum niina kum, a tha luk tha, ni masabel ni in Topa in kamsaangpa Haggai tungtawnin thu son hi. Shealtiel tapa Judah ngamukmangpa Zerubbabel atu le Jehozadak ii tapa Thiampi Lianbel Joshua atu in thupuak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaanglianbel Topa in Haggai tungah a cina pan, “Hi mite in tu hun sia Biakinnpi sakkik natu hunpha hi ngawl hi, ci uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Topa in kamsaangpa Haggai tungtawnin hi thu teng mite tungah pia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka mite awng, ka Biakinnpi a siacip sa in a om laitakin pha tak a kisa innte sungah banghang teang tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />No tungah bang thupiang cisia mu ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thaicii tam mama na tu uh a, ahizong an tawm bek na la uh hi. Anneak tawm tu na nei uh a, ahizong na khamkhop tu na nei bua uh hi. Sapittui neak tu na nei uh a, ahizong na kham tham tu na nei bua uh hi. Puansilh na nei uh a, ahizong a lum tham tu na nei bua uh hi. Tuaciang naseam khat in a nuntak khom natu thalaw zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hisia a pian theina thu he ngawl nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu in mual tungah kaato tavun a, inn thingte la in Biakinnpi sa kik vun; tuasia ciang kei ka lungkim tu a, a kilawm bangin kei hong kibia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Anlaak tu tam mama na lamen uh a, ahizong tawm bek piang hi. Tuaciang an laakte na ciapui uh ciang kong muutkeaksak hi. Banghang tuabang vawt khi ziam? Banghang ziam cile note mi sim in ama inn vawtin a komlaak laitakin ka Biakinnpi a siacip sa in om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua hu in nguazu ngawl a, bangma po thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima in leitang tung — a mualte, anciinna lote, sapithuante, olive ciinnate tung — lei pan a piang an namcin tung, mihingte le ngannote tung, na ciin sa theampo tungah nguatui kong hangsak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Zerubbabel, Joshua le Babylon ngam saltanna pan hong cia kik theampo in Topa a Pathian sawl bangin vawt uh hi. Amate lau ahiciang, Topa ii kamtaipa, kamsaang Haggai thu ni uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Haggai in hi Topa thupuak sia mipite tungah son hi: “Note taw kei kong omkhawm tu hi, ci in kong kamciam hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in Biakinnpi sak tu vai mi theampo thawn hi: Judah ngamuk mangpa Zerubbabel; Thiampi Lianbel Joshua, le saltanna pan hong ciakik mite theampo ahi hi. Amate ii Vaanglianbel Topa, a Pathian Biakinnpi ah a nasep kipat ni sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Darius kumpilianpa maan zawk a kum nii kum, tha luk tha, 24 ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua kum, a tha sali tha, ni 21 ni in Topa in kamsaang pa Haggai tungtawnin paupui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Haggai tungah Shealtiel tapa Judah ngamuk mangpa Zerubbabel, Thiampi Lianbel Joshua le mite tungah hi bang in sonsak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“No sungah mihing khat po in Biakinnpi bangza in nasia ngei kana ziam ci sia a ciamtee lai na om uh ziam? Tu in bangbangin na mu uh ziam? Tu a sia, son thamman ngawl bang hi nanak tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong tu in note khat zongh thinkiam heak vun. Na seam vun banghang ziam cile no taw keima kong omkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Egypt ngam pan nong pusua uh lai in a tawntung note taw kong omkhawm tu hi ci in kamciam kong pia hi. Tu zonghin note taw kong omkhawm nginge lai hi, tua ahikom lau heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hai ngawlin vantung le leitung, lei le tuipi ka lok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Minam theampo ka lawnthal tu a, amate sumngum theampo hi lai ah hong kipuak tu hi, tuaciang Biakinnpi in hauna taw kidim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Simleitung a ngunn le khamh theampo keima aa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Biakinnpi thak in a lui sia sangin nasia zaw tu hi, tuaciang tualai ah ka mite maa vanna le kilemna ka pia tu hi,” cisak hi. Vaanglianbelpa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Darius ii kumpilian a sep zawk a kum niina, a tha kua tha, ni 24 ni in Vaanglianbelpa Topa in kamsaangpa Haggai paupui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in, “Thiampite tungah hi dokna huvau thukhensatna khat ngen in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sonteena in sangaw biakpiakna sungah a kithiansua sabak khat a thiampi puantual sungah tun ci tawng. Tua zawkciang ama in a puantual taw anluum, an min sa, sapittui, olive thau, ahibuale an nam khat pawpo thutha le, tua an zong thiangsak tu ziam?” ci hi. Tuabang a dok ciang Thiampite in, “Thiangsak ngawl tu hi” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang Haggai in, “Sonteena, mihing khat in mithi a tham hu in nin hi ci tawng. Tua zawkciang ama in hi ante khat pawpo a tham le tuate zongh ninsak tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Thiampite in, “Ninsak tu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Haggai in, “ Topa in, hi ngam sungah mite le a piansak nate theampo tungah a piangte a kibangma hi ci hi; tua ahikom biaknatau tungah a piak theampo ninsak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in “No tungah hong piangsate mu thei ngawl nu ziam? Biakinnpi na sakkik ma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ansaal khat ah an kilogramme za nii mu tu in muangmaw a, na pai uh hang kilogramme za khat bek om hi. Bung khat sung pan sapittui litre zakhat duup tu in na pai uh hang sawmli bek om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na ciin sa na theampo lalsak tu in vuisa le ngialtang kong puak hi, ahizong na kisiik kik tuan bualai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuni sia tha kua tha, ni kul le ni li ni hi a, Biakinnpi tawdap phaana a kiman ni hi. Tu pan kipan bang hong piang tu ziam en tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Antang om nawn ngawl a, sapitkungte, theikungte, talee te le olive kungte nga ngawl lai ahitazong, tu pan kipan thupha kong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua tha, ni 24 ni ma in Topa ii Haggai tungah hi thupuak a niina sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah ngamuk mangpa Zerubbabel atu in puak hi: “Keima in van le lei lok tu in kithoai khi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />kumpi ngamte lumletin a thahatna ka bosak tu hi. Ngalleangte le a hawlte ka sawnthal tu hi; siphute thi in, a tung tote khat le khat kithatlum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ni ciang ka naseampa Zerubbabel awng, nang kong la tu a, keima min suangin a uk tu in panmun kong pia tu hi. Nangma kong teal sa khat na hi hi.” Vaanglianbelpa Topa in son zo hi.
  </para>
</usx>
